# bad/missing-inverse.aon --- change request CR-4718: email adds a
# directory lookup but nobody records the inverse on svc_directory.
# The dependsOn relation declares inverse(dependedOnBy) (spec.aon), so
# GENERATION refuses the unmirrored edge with a located
# relation_inverse_missing, and `aontu relations` reports the exact
# missing entry.
@"../system.aon"

change: cr4718: id(svc_email) & {
  dependsOn: [svc_directory]
}
